!/_system/brand/video/tour.mp4
!/_system/brand/video/tour-poster.jpg
!/60-outputs/site/assets/video/tour.mp4
!/60-outputs/site/assets/video/tour-poster.jpg

# Loose photos, transcripts and notes at the top level: only the known files live there.
